  "notes": "PCB overview (p.26-28) puts sensors on CN21, transducer CN20, HP CN24, LP CN25, EEV CN1, 4WV CN7, crankcase CN9, base pan CN8, W1 CN6, thermostat CN26 for 018-048, and sensors CN14, transducer CN21, HP CN12, LP CN13, EEV CN15, 4WV CN5, crankcase CN28, base pan CN4, W1 CN22 for 060. The error-code pages (p.85-86) instead say CN21/CN25/CN24/CN20 for \"24K&36K\" and CN14/CN13/CN12/CN21 for \"48K&60K\" - so the 042/048 connector set is uncertain: look at the board label. 060 thermostat connector not named in the overview (CN23/CN26 listed as display connectors). Which pin of the sensor plug carries which sensor is not stated.",
