  "test": "Status codes on amber LED and UI (Tables 4-7). To separate inverter vs compressor on code 69/77/95: power off, lift the 3 compressor leads at the inverter, run - same fault = inverter; 79 no-pump = compressor.",
  "notes": "Compressor winding: 024/036 0.681 ohm, 048/060 0.203 ohm between T1-T2-T3; >1 megohm to ground (do not megger). Low pressure (SPT): cool <=55 psig 3 min, any <13 psig instant, heat <23 psig 3 min.",
