    "pins": "Pin 1 RED = +12 VDC, pin 2 GRN = 12 VDC common (-), pin 3 YEL and pin 4 BLU = motor communication; to motor control plug RECP 4 (motor side pins 1 RED, 2 YEL, 3 BLU, 4 GRN)",
    "code": "ECM",
    "name": "ECM blower motor communication / 12 VDC connector",
