  "notes": "R-32 (A2L) heat pump. No thermistors, EEV or pressure transducers on the outdoor unit - snap-action defrost thermostat and on/off pressure switches. The refrigerant detection sensor (RDS) is in the indoor coil/air handler, not here. Defrost interval by tonnage (Region IV): 90 min except 3 ton = 60 min (install IOG for GLZS4B). This smaller-size board has one Y, one O, one W and two C terminals; terminal names otherwise match the larger board.",
