  "test": "24 V at TR 4-5 and EBTDR R-C. G call -> after 7 s EBTDR closes COM-NO -> motor runs on the speed lead on COM. Check the run capacitor and motor windings if the relay closes but the motor doesn't run.",
  "notes": "No thermistors, EEV or pressure sensors - fixed TXV/piston coil. Later ARUF / AR*F builds use an EEM (X13-type) motor and may use a different diagram (r103 p.110-111, AEPF p.111) - check the unit's own diagram.",
  "gaps": [
   "No EEM-motor ARUF diagram found - the current ARUF**14** diagram (IO-427L) is also PSC + EBTDR",
   "Exact NO/COM wiring to L1/L2 and the PLF pin colours not readable on this drawing"
  ],
  "sources": [
   {
    "file": "goodman-gsx-gsz-r410a-service-r103.pdf",
    "pages": "109",
    "what": "wiring diagram"
   },
   {
    "file": "IM-IO-427L.pdf",
    "pages": "19-20",
    "what": "EBTDR timing, ARUF**14**/ARPT**14** diagram"
   }
  ]
