  "test": "Board shows status/fault on the dual 7-segment display; hold TEST+SW2 5-8 s to read stored faults (FC). Thermistors: unplug and compare with the 10k chart. Transducers: back-probe Red/Black (supply ~5 V) and Green/Black (signal) and apply the formula.",
  "notes": "Defrost DIP table: DF1/DF2 off/off 60F (factory), on/off 50F, off/on 40F, on/on 70F (p.32/35). EXV superheat offset SH1/SH2 profiles A-D = 0, -4, -2, +2F (p.35). Source conflicts: discharge fold-back starts at 235F in the text (p.40, p.55) but 225F in the code table (p.51, T961_O); the code table says L29 (A958_O) and L21 (A957_O) lock out for one hour (p.51), while the text says the HPC lockout needs a manual power reset (p.40, p.57) and the low-pressure lockout must be manually reset (p.56). The board photo (p.34) labels the DIP banks DFST/EXV and 1600, not DF1/DF2/SH1/SH2.",
