  "test": "Read the 7-segment code (0 = standby, H/C/F = operating). Last 3 faults (under 1 week) flash after power reset. Flame LED shows flame quality. Check switches and limits for continuity with power off; check 24 VAC at gas valve and 120 VAC at P2 inducer during a heat call.",
  "notes": "Sequence: pressure switch checked open, 30 s pre-purge, 8 s trial, spark up to 7 s, flame proven, blower on about 20 s after ignition; 4 tries then 1-hour lockout. Source conflict: on Figure 54 the connection diagram names the P1-3/P3-3 switch NPC (vent system pressure switch), but the ladder schematic labels the same switch HPC; the connection diagram is kept.",
