  "test": "Green LED: heartbeat (bright-dim) = 24 V and no fault; codes are short flashes, '+' digit = long flashes. 2 pressure switch did not open; 3 LPS did not close or reopened; 4 limit circuit fault (rollout manual reset); 5 abnormal flame-proving signal; 6 ignition proving failure; 7 limit circuit lockout (> 3 min, auto reset 3 h); 8 gas heating lockout (no auto reset); 9 HPS did not close or reopened; 10 line polarity reversed; 1+2 blower on after power up; 6+1 ignition lockout (auto reset 3 h); OFF secondary fuse open / no power; ON SOLID control circuitry lockout (auto reset 1 h; replace control if it repeats). Recall: from idle jumper TEST/TWIN to C 2-3 s, or briefly pull one limit wire. (icp-n92esn-install-04si.pdf p63 (service label))",
  "notes": "Different diagram from N95ESN (344443-2 here vs A210134 there): green LED, single-digit codes, line-side XFMR and 115 V HUM terminals. N92ESN-03SI p.65 shows the same diagram.",
  "gaps": [
   "Limit open/close temperature not in manual",
   "Board part number not printed",
   "HUM 24VAC timing stated two ways in the manual (gas valve vs low pressure switch)"
  ],
